{"v":2,"id":"01M8H7NP5X64SFNZG5C296B94P","ts":"2026-11-28T14:06:45.949665Z","actor":"owner","type":"goal.add","node":"01M8H7NP5X64SFNZG5C296B94P","payload":{"role":"owner","words":"A rethink page becomes an issue that holds every item, and no item loses its holder without a check saying so","base":"ab2058b0376514e15eeb2e3aa2e212d592250671","base_tree":"2107b79b3b57e7b3d5882edb75de7f67b0917f39","budget":3,"from":"01M8GW5C5JZSVF29W0MZAZ5JBT","lines":[{"key":"line-1","text":"A script that hyp-grill ships draws an issue body from a rethink page's data file, with every item's id, tag and text in the page's sections","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-2","text":"The issue body that script draws has a holder table with one row for each item","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-3","text":"A script that hyp-grill ships reads an issue body and lists each item with no holder, or with a holder whose kind does not fit its tag, and exits 1","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-4","text":"hyp-grill says that the grill opens the issue from a page itself","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-5","text":"hyp-grill says that the grill runs the check of line-3 at every split and before any report of done","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-6","text":"hyp-grill says that an item too vague for a sharp line is held by a line of a written Goal that holds its words, and the grill sharpens it before the Goal opens","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-7","text":"The run rules and the re-grill say that a partial fix or a left-out part is recorded as a finding, by the runner or by the orchestrator at Selected, and that a PR's notes alone do not hold it","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-8","text":"hyp-grill says that at the end of each Goal the land and each remainder go to the tracking issue with their records, and that with no tracking issue each remainder is a finding only","kind":"gap"}],"examples":[{"line":"line-1","example":"a","hash":"cfb475558665f2868e622909023a03258f48918e","h0":{"commit":"ab2058b0376514e15eeb2e3aa2e212d592250671","row_tree":"210